E2%86%92-computed-property","type":"heading","text":"Pure value patch → computed property"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Add"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Transition\/interpolate"},{"type":"text","text":", and other pure-function patches carry no state."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"They fan an input through math and emit an output. In SwiftUI that’s a computed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"property (or an inline expression) — no "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@State"},{"type":"text","text":", no side effect."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Interaction-%E2%86%92-gesture-+-State","type":"heading","text":"Interaction → gesture + `@State`"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Origami’s Interaction patch exposes discrete output ports: ","type":"text"},{"code":"down","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"position","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"onTap","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"onDoubleTap","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"onLongPress","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Each maps to a SwiftUI gesture recognizer","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whose output lands in ","type":"text"},{"code":"@State","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or fires a callback. The ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction","type":"reference"},{"text":" helper","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"attaches only the recognizer for each output the caller requests, which keeps","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"gesture arbitration clean.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Statememory-%E2%86%92-State-+-update-logic","type":"heading","text":"State\/memory → `@State` + update logic"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"Switch","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"